      "name": "edit_sheet_text",
      "description": "Correct the wording on an existing sheet without redrawing it. Use this for any sheet a person drew: update_diagram regenerates layout from a spec, so it discards hand-placed elements, region containers, and unbound annotations. This rewrites only the text you name and leaves every other element, and every coordinate, exactly as it was.",
